    },
    "kolonne": "notes",
    "index": 2,
    "vaerdi": "DUAL-BATTERY RUNTIME NOT USED AS THE MAIN VALUE: the table shows '1.5-2h' in the runtime row itself, and separately in the same cell (line break) '3h (Dual Battery)' - an accessory-dependent extended configuration. The main value is 1.5-2 hours; the dual-battery figure of 3h is stated in the caveat, not in value/max."
  },
  {
    "robot_id": 2254,
    "slug": "yuejia-yj30",
    "tabel": "robots",
    "noegle": {
