    },
    "kolonne": "notes",
    "index": 3,
    "vaerdi": "LIDAR NOT FILLED IN: the product-feature text mentions (multimodal sensor matrix: laser-vision synergy), which hints at some form of laser/LiDAR - but the table itself (the structured specification table) has NO lidar row at all. The field is therefore not disclosed, not inferred from the marketing text - the same principle as GENISOM L2's handling of a similar mismatch between prose and table."
  },
